(
    'Automated daily cattle weighing via RFID-based data collection and analysis system — saved 3,000+ hours per year of manual labor at the University of Saskatchewan (May 2023 - Aug 2023). RFID (Radio Frequency Identification) is a wireless technology using radio waves to automatically identify and track tags attached to objects — here, ear tags on cattle.',
