    'Trained and evaluated ML models (machine learning classification algorithms) for cattle health monitoring using farm-based IoT sensor data at IIT Ropar (Jul 2022 - Sep 2022). IoT (Internet of Things) sensors collected accelerometer and temperature data from cattle to predict health events without manual observation.',
