(
    'Built the RAG-Powered Portfolio Chatbot — the AI chat on this very portfolio site — as a 3-repo Go system: portfolio-store (Neon PostgreSQL + pgvector), rag-chatbot (Go API on Render), and portfolio-website (Next.js on Vercel). It streams LLM responses over SSE and retrieves context with hybrid search: pgvector cosine similarity plus Postgres full-text search, merged by Reciprocal Rank Fusion, returning the top 5 chunks per query.',
    'portfolio_rag_project',
